<h2 class="nfv-footer-about-title">About NfLV</h2>
<p class="nfv-footer-about-copy">Established in 1991 in Badagry, the Nigeria French Language Village is an Inter-University Centre for French Studies. Through language immersion, teaching and cultural exchange, we connect learners with the wider Francophone world.</p>
